{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-35376","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38981","text":"Agentelic Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38982","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build agents like software. Spec-driven. Tested. Deployed."}]}],"id":"blk-35377","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35380","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38983","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-38984","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-38985","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-38986","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-38987","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-38988","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-38989","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-35379","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-35381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38990","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-38991","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"},{"id":"spn-38992","text":" — a premium, enterprise-grade agent builder that brings software engineering discipline to AI agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-35382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38993","text":"Agentelic targets the engineering teams that need to ship reliable agents to production — with versioned specs, deterministic testing, staged rollouts, and compliance gates. While the market is flooded with no-code agent builders optimized for demos, Agentelic is optimized for production."}]},{"id":"blk-35383","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38994","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35384","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-38995","text":"What Agentelic Does"}]},{"id":"blk-35385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38996","text":"Agentelic is the "},{"id":"spn-38997","marks":["bold"],"text":"engineering layer"},{"id":"spn-38998","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem:"}]},{"id":"blk-35386","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (Standards)    → defines agent behavior as versioned specs\n    ↓\nAgentelic (Engineering)   → builds, tests, deploys agents against specs  ← THIS\n    ↓\nOpenSentience (Runtime)   → governs, executes, observes agents locally\n    ↓\nGraphonomous (Memory)     → continual learning knowledge graphs\n    ↓\nFleetPrompt (Distribution) · Delegatic (Orchestration)"},{"id":"blk-35387","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-38999","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-35388","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39000","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec-driven builds"},{"id":"spn-39001","text":" — Every agent starts from a SpecPrompt specification."}]}],"id":"blk-35389","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35391","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39002","text":"Parse, generate, compile, and package in one pipeline."}]},{"id":"blk-35392","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39003","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deterministic testing"},{"id":"spn-39004","text":" — Tests are derived from acceptance criteria, not"}]}],"id":"blk-35393","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39005","text":"hand-written. Mocked tool calls, output validation, regression suites."}]},{"id":"blk-35396","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39006","marks":["bold"],"text":"Staged deployment"},{"id":"spn-39007","text":" — Staging → canary → production with permission review"}]}],"id":"blk-35397","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39008","text":"gates and compliance checks."}]},{"id":"blk-35400","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-35402","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39009","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool surface"},{"id":"spn-39010","text":" — The entire build pipeline is exposed as MCP tools for"}]}],"id":"blk-35401","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-35403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39011","text":"AI-assisted agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-35404","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-39012","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-35405","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-39013","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-35406","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-35407","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-35408","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: Agentelic Docs\n\nspec/README"},{"id":"blk-35409","kind":"paragraph","s